## parallel-groups

### group: main
**Type:** sequential  
**Steps:**
- Freeze v1 package/file layout so builders do not collide: `contract`, `renderer`, `sections/`, `templates/`, `styles/`, `assets/`, `runner`, tests, agent docs.
- Lock exact `memoria.html` contract: stable section ids (`portada`, `indice`, `teoria-calculo`, `resultados-calculo`, `seleccion-equipos`, `fin`), expected data inputs, asset path rules, status/error vocabulary.
- Define renderer seam once: `load artifacts -> stage assets -> build section view-models -> render HTML -> write memoria.html`.
- Freeze shared conventions: Arial base, local asset URLs only, placeholder policy, KaTeX embedding mode, index anchor format, print-oriented CSS entrypoint.
- Milestone M1: architecture + interfaces fixed; parallel work can proceed without redesign.

